  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45428</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>聖都の時と方角が違わないか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wasn't pointing somewhere else just a second ago?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは…………
だめ……何かに抑えられてる
みたいで、場所がよくわからない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm not sure... I can't seem to quite place it, like something's stopping me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっと、&lt;Kohaku&gt;！
ボクたち、お尋ね者なんだから
人前でピカピカ光らないでよっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Psst, Kohaku! We're wanted people, remember? Maybe don't go starting a light show in front of everyone!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お前もデカイ声で
『お尋ね者』言うなっての！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe YOU don't go shoutin' "wanted people"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>別に驚きも、通報もしねぇよ。
世間の事なんて
わしはどうでもいいんでな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't matter to me, I ain't gonna go reporting ya. I couldn't care less about world affairs...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47252</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世間に興味がなくて
商人なんてやってけるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Doesn't a merchant kinda NEED to be in on that sorta thing?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんな辺境にも、いくつか特産物は
あるからな。それを商うだけで
一人なら食っていけるさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In such a remote area all you need is a few local specialties. You can get by just trading those alone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わしも若い頃は一家で世界中を
回ったもんだが、統一戦争に巻き
こまれて、親父も嫁も息子たちも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When I was younger, my family used to travel all across the world. But then we all got caught up in the war of unificaton. My father, son and daughter-in-law all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>全員死んじまったよ。
……以来十数年、わしも生きな
がら死んでるようなもんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They all lost their lives thanks to this damn war. It's been over ten years since... yet I still feel like I died along with them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一家で商売……
オーブさんたち……無事かな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A merchant family? Do you think... Obe's family are alright?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オーブは機転がきく。
アンも幼児にしては勇敢な少女だ。
心配はあるまい。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Obe is a quick-witted individual, and Ann is quite brave for such a young child. You have nothing to worry about.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48748</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;……
なぐさめて……くれてるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you... comforting me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>否。
自分は客観的事実を
述べただけだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Negative. I am simply stating facts.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49200</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おじいさん
ここから西に街はある？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText> 'Scuse me sir, is there a town west of here?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この先にゃ、最果ての船着場と
北の海があるだけよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Only the docks, and then nothing but the northern ocean...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、まさか
最後のスピルーンって……海の底!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh no... don't tell me the last Spirune's at the BOTTOM OF THE OCEAN!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……とにかく船着場まで
行ってみましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Well, might as well head to the docks then.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
